# CAREFUL: Cloudflare's HTML handling serves /foo for foo.html and 301s
# /foo.html -> /foo to drop the extension. So a rule whose TARGET ends in
# .html gets bounced straight back to its own source and loops forever
# (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS). Every target below is extensionless, and no
# target equals its own source, so no rule here can loop.

# Old case-study URL from the previous build, in both forms.
/casestudyaiintake.html   /case-study-ai-intake   301
/casestudyaiintake        /case-study-ai-intake   301
